							<Entry Name="Status Word" Index="#x6041" Flags="#x00002000">
								<Type>UINT</Type>
								<Comment>object 0x6041:0
- Bit 0: Ready to switch on
- Bit 1: Switched on
- Bit 2: Operation enabled
- Bit 3: Fault
- Bit 5: Quick stop
- Bit 6: Switch on disabled
- Bit 7: Warning
- Bit 8: Follow me
- Bit 10: Target reached (PP/PV/HM)
- Bit 11: Internal limit active
- Bit 12: Drive follows the command value (cyclic modes of operation), Setpoint acknowledge (PP), Speed (PV), Homing attained (HM)
- Bit 13: Following error (PP), Homing error (HM)
- Bit 15: Reference done</Comment>
